{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>I will whistle for them</b> — for the remnant in Assyria and in Egypt." "<b>And they shall multiply</b> — in their exile in a foreign land." "<b>As they multiplied</b> — in ancient days in their land. And this is like the Gaon [Saadia]." "<b>And the word כמו רבו</b> — is superfluous, for the construction should be כאשר רבו."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:38.367459734Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}